                                        "sense_id": "edb2aef9-e891-3761-86c6-014afb915703",
                                        "entry_id": "adc0e160-ac33-3027-ab2f-b7131e3599e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A computer application for organization, analysis, and storage of data in tabular form."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2f89c9f-56de-4ec2-93bd-d7b3bcfd9e03",
                                                "sense_id": "edb2aef9-e891-3761-86c6-014afb915703",
                                                "text": "The program's most quintessentially Macintoshian feature, one as yet unique among spreadsheets, is its icon bar, which resides at the top of the screen just below the standard menu bar."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "043ef585-0402-3950-b470-7fdff82a4fd2",
                                        "entry_id": "adc0e160-ac33-3027-ab2f-b7131e3599e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A document created with such an application."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3752a8fb-52cd-40b4-bc5a-2aad57b5c61d",
                                                "sense_id": "043ef585-0402-3950-b470-7fdff82a4fd2",
                                                "text": "A little later in this chapter, we'll run through some of the most common methods journalists use to analyze the material they gather and store in spreadsheets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "751520d0-402b-4f81-af6d-af5d17e36528",
                                                "sense_id": "043ef585-0402-3950-b470-7fdff82a4fd2",
                                                "text": "For example, my own entry into the world of theorycrafting happened when I took somebody’s prot paladin spreadsheet and translated it into MATLAB code."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b304e11c-e82a-31e3-97e0-8cdd023d315f",
                                        "entry_id": "adc0e160-ac33-3027-ab2f-b7131e3599e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sheet of paper, marked with a grid, in which financial data is recorded and totals calculated manually."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "spreadsheet",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a128d5cd-66f4-374c-baf6-8eadfcdb817c",
                                        "entry_id": "e740c3c8-7707-3e29-b260-ce4f229a4948",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To model or compute by means of a spreadsheet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2654887-3024-4df8-8502-7bd78cdd023c",
                                                "sense_id": "a128d5cd-66f4-374c-baf6-8eadfcdb817c",
                                                "text": "If you'd spreadsheeted the cascade charts and sorted it by each name's sphere of influence, then the people Carrie Johnstone sent the police to get constituted a big chunk of the middle third—people who “commanded” maybe four of five others—and maybe 10 percent of the top influencers."
                                            }
